		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=19373#p19373"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>J&#039;utilise l&#039;ETL Data Manager de Cognos pour transférer des données dans une base PostgreSQL.<br />Version du driver PostgreSQL ODBC utilisée: Driver Version=&#039;09.03.0100,201312170000&#039;</p><p>J&#039;ai une erreur dans l&#039;application &quot;A general exception has occurred during the operation &quot;bind arguments&quot;.&quot;</p><p>En utilisant une base Oracle ou MSSQL pas d&#039;erreur, cela ne se produit qu&#039;avec PostgreSQL.</p><p>Je n&#039;arrive pas vraiment a trouver d&#039;info pertinente dans les log (mylogxxx.log) </p><p>Ci-dessous la fin du log:<br />...<br />[4476-8.828][[SQLEndTran]][4476-8.828]entering PGAPI_Transact: hdbc=0B0E4328, henv=00000000<br />[4476-8.828]PGAPI_Transact: sending on conn 0B0E4328 &#039;1&#039;<br />[4476-8.828]CC_send_query: conn=0B0E4328, query=&#039;ROLLBACK&#039;<br />[4476-8.828]send_query: done sending query 14bytes flushed<br />[4476-8.828]in QR_Constructor<br />[4476-8.828]exit QR_Constructor<br />[4476-8.828]read 20, global_socket_buffersize=4096<br />[4476-8.828]send_query: got id = &#039;C&#039;<br />[4476-8.828]send_query: ok - &#039;C&#039; - ROLLBACK<br />[4476-8.828]send_query: setting cmdbuffer = &#039;ROLLBACK&#039;<br />[4476-8.844]send_query: returning res = 0B0ECC30<br />[4476-8.844]send_query: got id = &#039;Z&#039;<br />[4476-8.844]CC_on_abort in<br />[4476-8.844]CC_abort:&#160; sending ABORT!<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: enter DESTRUCTOR<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: in QR_close_result<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: free memory in, fcount=0<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: free memory out<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: exit close_result<br />[4476-8.844]QResult: exit DESTRUCTOR<br />[4476-8.844][SQLDisconnect for 0B0E4328][4476-8.844]PGAPI_Disconnect: entering...&#160; </p><p>Auriez vous des idées ?</p><p>Merci pour votre aide.</p>]]></content>
